<!-- 抽签 · 点名 · 随机分组（校园小工具）
     视觉：工具主题 · 名单 → 模式 → 结果 三段式，纯本地随机，无网络请求
     装饰签名（见 docs/dev/MP-VISUAL-SYSTEM.md）：flow-thick + dot-c -->
<view
  class="qz-page th-toolkit lottery"
  bindtouchstart="onFxStart"
  bindtouchmove="onFxMove"
  bindtouchend="onFxEnd"
  bindtouchcancel="onFxEnd"
>
  <!-- 装饰层（不拦截点击；只有装饰层跟随指针，内容区不跟随） -->
  <view class="qz-deco">
    <view class="qz-fx" style="{{fxStyle}}">
      <view class="qz-flow qz-flow-thick"></view>
      <view class="qz-dot qz-dot-c"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="qz-content">
    <view class="head qz-an-in">
      <text class="title">抽签</text>
      <text class="sub">点名 · 抽签 · 分组，全部本地随机，名单不上传</text>
    </view>

    <!-- ---------- 名单 ---------- -->
    <view class="qz-card qz-an-in qz-d1">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>名单</text>
        <text class="card-title-hint">一行一个，可直接粘贴</text>
      </view>

      <textarea
        class="roster"
        value="{{rosterText}}"
        placeholder="张三&#10;李四&#10;王五"
        placeholder-class="roster-ph"
        maxlength="-1"
        auto-height
        bindinput="onRosterInput"
      />

      <view class="actions">
        <view class="btn btn-ghost qz-press" bindtap="applyRoster">用这份名单</view>
        <view class="btn btn-ghost qz-press" bindtap="onRosterClear">清空</view>
      </view>

      <text class="hint" wx:if="{{rosterHint}}">{{rosterHint}}</text>
    </view>

    <!-- ---------- 模式 ---------- -->
    <view class="qz-card qz-an-in qz-d2">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>怎么抽</text>
      </view>

      <view class="tabs">
        <view
          class="tab qz-press {{mode === item.key ? 'tab-on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{modes}}"
          wx:key="key"
          data-key="{{item.key}}"
          bindtap="onModeTap"
        >
          <text class="tab-label">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="tab-hint">{{item.hint}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="stepper" wx:if="{{mode === 'draw'}}">
        <text class="stepper-label">一次抽几个</text>
        <view class="step qz-press" data-field="drawCount" data-delta="-1" bindtap="onCountStep">−</view>
        <text class="step-value">{{drawCount}}</text>
        <view class="step qz-press" data-field="drawCount" data-delta="1" bindtap="onCountStep">+</view>
      </view>

      <view class="stepper" wx:if="{{mode === 'group'}}">
        <text class="stepper-label">分成几组</text>
        <view class="step qz-press" data-field="groupCount" data-delta="-1" bindtap="onCountStep">−</view>
        <text class="step-value">{{groupCount}}</text>
        <view class="step qz-press" data-field="groupCount" data-delta="1" bindtap="onCountStep">+</view>
      </view>

      <view class="switch-row" wx:if="{{mode === 'pick'}}">
        <view class="switch-body">
          <text class="switch-label">不重复点名</text>
          <text class="switch-hint">抽过的人不再进候选池</text>
        </view>
        <view class="toggle qz-press {{noRepeat ? 'toggle-on' : ''}}" bindtap="onToggleNoRepeat">
          <view class="knob"></view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="switch-row" wx:if="{{mode === 'pick' && history.length}}">
        <text class="switch-label">已经抽过 {{history.length}} 人</text>
        <view class="link qz-press" bindtap="onResetHistory">重置</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="btn btn-solid qz-press qz-an-in qz-d3" bindtap="onStart">开始抽</view>

    <!-- ---------- 结果 ---------- -->
    <view class="qz-card result qz-an-in" wx:if="{{error}}">
      <text class="err-title">这次抽不了</text>
      <text class="hint">{{error}}</text>
    </view>

    <block wx:elif="{{hasResult}}">
      <view class="qz-card result qz-an-in" wx:if="{{picked.length}}">
        <view class="card-title">
          <text>抽中了</text>
          <text class="card-title-hint">{{strong ? '设备安全随机' : '普通随机'}}</text>
        </view>

        <view class="picked">
          <text class="picked-name" wx:for="{{picked}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text>
        </view>

        <text class="hint" wx:if="{{!strong}}">
          这台设备取不到密码学随机数，本次结果由 Math.random 生成 ——
          日常点名够用，但理论上可被预测。
        </text>

        <view class="actions">
          <view class="btn btn-ghost qz-press" bindtap="onCopyResult">复制结果</view>
          <view
            class="btn btn-ghost qz-press"
            wx:if="{{mode === 'pick' && noRepeat}}"
            bindtap="onResetHistory"
          >
            重置已抽
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="qz-card result qz-an-in" wx:if="{{groups.length}}">
        <view class="card-title">
          <text>分组结果</text>
          <text class="card-title-hint">{{strong ? '设备安全随机' : '普通随机'}}</text>
        </view>

        <view class="group qz-card-tint" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="key">
          <text class="group-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <view class="group-members">
            <text class="group-name" wx:for="{{item.members}}" wx:for-item="m" wx:key="*this">
              {{m}}
            </text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <text class="hint" wx:if="{{!strong}}">
          这台设备取不到密码学随机数，本次结果由 Math.random 生成 ——
          日常分组够用，但理论上可被预测。
        </text>

        <view class="actions">
          <view class="btn btn-ghost qz-press" bindtap="onCopyResult">复制结果</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="qz-card empty qz-an-in" wx:elif="{{!names.length}}">
      <text class="empty-title">把名字粘进来就能抽</text>
      <text class="hint">
        一行一个名字；从 Excel 或学号表直接复制也行，行首的序号会自动去掉。
        名单只存在这台手机上，不联网、不上传。
      </text>
    </view>

    <view class="qz-card empty qz-an-in" wx:else>
      <text class="empty-title">点上面的「开始抽」</text>
      <text class="hint">
        抽签用设备安全随机数，每次结果独立；分组只保证人数尽量平均，
        不保证性别、宿舍等任何维度的均衡。
      </text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
